                                "sense_id": "2f6f0a2c-7252-3035-b607-065b84734a41",
                                "text": "[T]he butler had entered, bearing in a toplofty fashion a huge silver platter, upon which lay a superb salmon, beautifully cooked and garnished."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "409db9bd-6423-4e0b-ac04-0826bb172c3d",
                                "sense_id": "2f6f0a2c-7252-3035-b607-065b84734a41",
                                "text": "Britain's Manchester Guardian . . . often irritates politicians with toplofty editorials suggesting that the paper is not only on the side of the angels but right alongside them in heaven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2c2fafc9-2b44-43f2-b921-960315eb06a1",
                                "sense_id": "2f6f0a2c-7252-3035-b607-065b84734a41",
                                "text": "A more toplofty, chilling man she had never known."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
